cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below. Cite the data sources as well.
type: software
title: Metal-oxide nano-QSAR reanalysis
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-11-24"
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/Ishitta-Sarkar/nanotoxicity-predictor
abstract: >
  Leave-one-out linear reanalysis of the Gajewicz et al. HaCaT and Puzyn et al.
  Escherichia coli metal-oxide cytotoxicity tables deposited in QsarDB. The
  deposited descriptors are compared with a mean baseline.
